Scope. This licence covers the files written for this repository and the
folders imported from Mark Green's repositories, which were published under
the MIT licence and keep their own copyright notices (see ATTRIBUTION.md).
The folders imported from the Liverpool City Region Civic Data Cooperative's
repositories (papers/2022-asymptomatic-testing-admissions,
papers/2023-mobile-vaccination-units, papers/2025-tier3-hospitalisations)
were published without a licence and remain under their authors' copyright
until the authors confirm the terms. The study documents and anonymised data
for SMART Release & Return are shared under the terms described in the
published paper's data availability statement.
